{"_v":1,"id":"a-raisin-in-the-sun-2004","bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":1,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/a-raisin-sun-theater-review-693457","d":"2004-03-30","q":"The warmth as well as the frictions and frustrations of a real family ripple through this lived-in production."},{"cn":"David Finkle","o":"HuffPost","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"http://www.huffingtonpost.com/david-finkle/first-nighter-denzel-wash_b_5088078.html","d":"2004-03-30","q":"I spent too much time thinking about how Washington is older than his character, and not enough time enjoying his performance."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":43,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.amny.com/entertainment/theater-review-a-raisin-in-the-sun-2-stars-1.7598557","d":"2004-03-30","q":"In addition to the age issue, Washington overplays Walter Lee’s moodiness and often adds an inappropriately jocular and hammy tone, encouraging the audience to laugh during some of the play’s most heartbreaking moments."}],"au":{"score":93,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"mz":{"s":93,"c":3,"sr":4.7}}},"pd":"2004-03-30","ca":[{"n":"Sean Combs","r":"Walter Lee Younger"},{"n":"Audra McDonald","r":"Ruth Younger"},{"n":"Phylicia Rashad","r":"Lena Younger"},{"n":"Sanaa Lathan","r":"Beneatha Younger"},{"n":"Bill Nunn","r":"Bobo"},{"n":"David Aaron Baker","r":"Karl Lindner"},{"n":"Lawrence Ballard","r":"Moving Man"},{"n":"Teagle F. Bougere","r":"Joseph Asagai"},{"n":"Frank Harts","r":"George Murchison"},{"n":"Billy Eugene Jones","r":"Moving Man"},{"n":"Alexander Mitchell","r":"Travis Younger"}]}